# Committed from Windows dev machines but installed on Linux hosting
# (GoDaddy) — npm's optional-dependency resolution for platform-specific
# native binaries (Rollup, esbuild, etc.) gets it wrong across that OS
# mismatch when a lockfile from the other platform is present. Each
# environment now resolves and keeps its own.
package-lock.json
.env
.env*
.env*.local
